# RS3 Developer Tools

Monorepo for a Lua-native developer toolkit for official RuneScape 3 plugins. See AGENTS.md for the full guide.

## Layout

- `packages/stubs-generator` crawls developer.runescape.com and emits LuaLS stubs (signatures only)
- `packages/luals-stubs` generated stubs, index.json, unresolved.md
- `packages/schema` plugin.json JSON Schema
- `packages/core` shared logic: validate, scaffold, preflight, sync, watch, package, docs cache
- `packages/cli` rs3dev command line
- `packages/mcp` @tmhs/rs3-plugin-mcp stdio server
- `cursor-plugin/` rules, skills and AGENTS.md installed into plugin workspaces
- `examples/hello-counter` reference plugin checked by LuaLS in CI

## Conventions

- Conventional commits on main only; never force push
- No emojis and no em dashes anywhere (code, docs, commits, output); a test enforces this
- Never commit documentation prose from developer.runescape.com; stubs carry signatures and @see links only
- Never read or index other developers' plugin code; only this workspace and developer.runescape.com
- Text files are UTF-8 without BOM, LF line endings
- TypeScript strict, ESM, Node 22+; tests with vitest
